 who skips his classes  almost every day he also hits on his  teachers and frequently gets in trouble  because of it like his siblings his  lifestyle consists of partying and using  his parents money in vain when jermaine  is in his office he sees a bill for his  children's expenses from the past month  looking at the numbers kareem warns him  against his children's careless spending  habits german knows that he has to teach  them the importance of money but doesn't  know how that afternoon javi brings his  friends on an impromptu trip to miami  disregarding the fact that he was given  an important task by his father in the  evening barbie is enjoying her birthday  party she sees lucho on the other side  of the room and asks him to clean a  stain off her dress lucho sighs thinking  that she hasn't grown a day since they  last met peter sees them getting close  and interrupts the conversation he  jermaine and barbie go to a private room  at his request he then asks german's  permission to marry his daughter  jermaine in turn questions him how he's  going to keep her happy when he doesn't  have a job barbie interrupts and replies  that they will use her trust fund  knowing that peter is not a good person  german disapproves of the marriage but  barbie doesn't back down she simply  walks outside and announces that she and  peter are engaged and are soon to be  married german is already worried about  his daughter but the problems add up  when he finds out have he ditched the  important meeting that he was assigned  to right after he gets a call from  charlie's college's dean saying that he  was caught having sex with his teacher  and was given a high five i mean was  expelled because of the stress germain  has difficulty breathing and is taken to  the hospital when his children come to  see him he pretends to have gotten a  heart attack he hopes that the siblings  will feel responsible for giving him too  much trouble but much to his  disappointment they start arguing 