y refused to  help him somewhere else barbie calls  peter and tells him they have to  postpone the wedding after finding out  about their situation he is distressed  that he couldn't profit off their money  when he had the chance charlie is the  only one who goes to look for a job upon  his father's request he easily gets a  job at a bank his boss is rude to him  because the position was supposed to be  her niece's ha rich nepotism beats  regular nepotism she threatens to fire  him any chance she gets when the family  reunites at the end of the day they  handed german whatever money they were  able to collect barbie has earned the  most but it turns out she sold havey's  watch for it moments later their  faithful maid maggie and lucho come to  the house to help them they also bring  clothes for the family to change into  lucho takes advantage of barbie's  situation to trouble her as she did to  him when they were teens upon his aunt's  request he provides her with a job as a  waitress in a restaurant that he works  at when javi asks if there is any work  for him too he is given the job of a  public vehicle driver the following day  is javi's first day of work everything  goes well until another vehicle cuts in  line before them and the driver makes  fun of him meanwhile barbie also goes to  the restaurant and is disgusted to see  chefs spitting on customers meals she is  made to change into a uniform in a  shared locker room when she retaliates  lucho claims that she deserves  everything she is facing currently  because of her unlikable personality as  much as i want to side with lucho this  is kind of illegal as time passes the  siblings start adjusting to their new  life cooking and cleaning for themselves  although they struggle initially they  soon get a hang of it havi's rivalry  with a bus driver continues for weeks  one day he tries to race him to a  parking spot and is stopped by the  traffic police barbie is not very good  at being a waitress she is mean to the  rude customers which causes them to walk  away without paying eventually she  learns to flirt for better tips one day  charlie makes a mistake at his banking  job and his boss calls him to her office  to his surprise she closes the door and  suggests he do something right to make  up for the mistake the two end up having  sex in the office  one night after dinner jermaine  discovers barbie trying to make herself  puke to maintain her weight he is in  shock to find out that she's been doing  it since she was in college and was  diagnosed with bulimia a few years ago  barbie laughs claiming that he'd never  had time for his children so she didn't  expect him to care german realizes how  absent he has been from his children's  lives until now somewhere else peter and  his friend are talking about how he  missed the chance to pay off his debts  he also tells the guy everything about  the bankruptcy and kareem fleeing with  the money peter's friend doesn't believe  him because kareem is right behind them  talking to someone peter registers that  something is wrong and begins to  investigate the next day lucho and  barbie go to the market together they  bond while buying groceries for the  restaurant and trying several street  foods meanwhile javi finds his  competitor bus driver and starts a fight  with him they suddenly stop after  finding it they both read the books by  the same author on talking to each other  they learn that their ambition in life  is the same to start a business of their  own a few weeks later the family earns  enough money to be able to renovate the  house while they're at it jermaine  mentions how bad heavy is at spelling  things javi reveals that he is dyslexic  and has gone to therapy for it german is  left speechless when told that he paid  for the therapy sessions he feels guilty  about having not paid attention to his  children's lives the next day at the  restaurant the owner throws a party for  his employees barbie and lucho dance and  eventually kiss at the same time peter  arrives at their house and meets german  he claims to know everything about  german's lies and threatens to reveal  the truth to his children scared that  they will hate him after finding out  german asks him what he wants just then  barbie arrives home and sees them peter  informs the family that kareem has  returned with the funds and their bank  accounts are working again this means  that they can go back to their old  lifestyle the siblings are overjoyed to  be able to return home german on the  other hand is blackmailed into staying  silent the family gets ready to leave  and barbie meets lucho outside she  reluctantly wishes him farewell and  leaves she believes that since peter  helped her in a situation like this she  cannot betray him and go to lucho the  next day jermaine goes to the office and  asks kareem for a solution he wants to  keep the secret from his kids but will  at no cost allow barbie to marry peter  barbie starts shopping for her wedding  even though her heart is not in it she  only does it because she feels indebted  to peter in the following scene jermaine  and kareem are in a meeting with peter  and a lawyer german offers peter money  to walk out of barbie's life however  peter is adamant about wanting to marry  her in the end german has to sign a  contract that says barbie's husband will  be authorized to use as much money as he  likes from her trust fund he still hopes  that peter won't be the said husband  following the meeting jermaine goes to  meet his family maid maggie she advises  him to tell his kids the truth because  the longer he hides it the longer they  will take to forgive him german trusts  her and decides to do the right thing  but he is unaware that somewhere else  peter is proposing to his daughter he  asks her to sign the marriage papers  immediately because he cannot wait  anymore barbie is nervous and unsure if  she even wants to marry him still she  follows his lead and goes 