y refused to  help him somewhere else barbie calls  peter and tells him they have to  postpone the wedding after finding out  about their situation he is distressed  that he couldn't profit off their money  when he had the chance charlie is the  only one who goes to look for a job upon  his father's request he easily gets a  job at a bank his boss is rude to him  because the position was supposed to be  her niece's ha rich nepotism beats  regular nepotism she threatens to fire  him any chance she gets when the family  reunites at the end of the day they  handed german whatever money they were  able to collect barbie has earned the  most but it turns out she sold havey's  watch for it moments later their  faithful maid maggie and lucho come to  the house to help them they also bring  clothes for the family to change into  lucho takes advantage of barbie's  situation to trouble her as she did to  him when they were teens upon his aunt's  request he provides her with a job as a  waitress in a restaurant that he works  at when javi asks if there is any work  for him too he is given the job of a  public vehicle driver the following day  is javi's first day of work everything  goes well until another vehicle cuts in  line before them and the driver makes  fun of him meanwhile barbie also goes to  the restaurant and is disgusted to see  chefs spitting on customers meals she is  made to change into a uniform in a  shared locker room when she retaliates  lucho claims that she deserves  everything she is facing currently  because of her unlikable personality as  much as i want to side with lucho this  is kind of illegal as time passes the  siblings start adjusting to their new  life cooking and cleaning for themselves  although they struggle initially they  soon get a hang of it havi's rivalry  with a bus driver continues for weeks  one day he tries to race him to a  parking spot and is stopped by the  traffic police barbie is not very good  at being a waitress she is mean to